docs {
  # GET /apis/artworks/galleries/1/ — Retrieve a gallery

  Returns a single gallery by ID. Requires `Authorization: Token`.

  ## Status codes

  - `200 OK` — success
  - `401 Unauthorized` — missing or invalid token
  - `404 Not Found` — gallery does not exist

  ## Response (200)

  `curator` is `null` when the referenced ArtCurator is inactive; otherwise `{id, slug}`.

  ```json
  {
    "id": 1,
    "slug": "galeria-oaxaca",
    "is_active": true,
    "created_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-17T10:00:00Z",
    "logo": "https://enredarte-dashboard.localhost/media/galleries/oaxaca.webp",
    "curator": { "id": 1, "slug": "maria-rodriguez" },
    "translations": {
      "es": { "name": "Galería Oaxaca", "description": "Galería de arte contemporáneo." },
      "en": { "name": "Oaxaca Gallery", "description": "Contemporary art gallery." }
    },
    "artwork_links": [
      { "id": 1, "artwork": { "id": 1, "slug": "la-columna-rota" }, "sort_order": 0 }
    ]
  }
  ```

  `artwork_links` contains only active artwork links (active link row + active artwork).

  ## Error (401)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid token.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```

  ## Error (404)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Not found.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```
}
